RustboroCity_Gym_Text_H0_0::
	.string "A CHAMPION from KANTO? Welcome.\p"
	.string "I am ROXANNE. My students say a\n"
	.string "battle teaches more than a book.\p"
	.string "Then let us put that to the test.\n"
	.string "Show me how you read a battle!$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_H0_1::
	.string "A sound strategy, tested in battle.\n"
	.string "I still have much to learn.$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_H0_2::
	.string "A type chart is a starting point.\n"
	.string "What you do with it is your own.\p"
	.string "I will have a new lesson for my\n"
	.string "students tomorrow.$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedStoneBadge::
	.string "Your victory earns the STONE BADGE.\p"
	.string "{PLAYER} received the STONE BADGE\n"
	.string "from ROXANNE!{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_OBTAIN_BADGE}{PAUSE 0xFE}{PAUSE 0x56}{RESUME_MUSIC}\p"
	.string "The keeper at SLATEPORT's harbor\n"
	.string "will add it to your HOENN record.$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_TakeTM39::
	.string "Take TM39 as well. A practical\n"
	.string "lesson to carry with you.$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM39::
	.string "{PLAYER} received TM39\n"
	.string "from ROXANNE!$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_ExplainTM39::
	.string "ROCK TOMB lowers the foe's SPEED.\n"
	.string "Control the pace, and a slow\l"
	.string "POKéMON can take the next move.\p"
	.string "A TM can only be used once.\n"
	.string "Choose its student carefully.$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_NoRoomForTM39::
	.string "You cannot carry another TM39.\n"
	.string "I will keep it until you have room.\p"
	.string "Your STONE BADGE is already yours.$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_Pikachu::
	.string "You brought PIKACHU to a ROCK GYM.\n"
	.string "That takes some nerve.\p"
	.string "GOLEM's GROUND type blocks its\n"
	.string "electricity. NOSEPASS can aim\l"
	.string "ZAP CANNON with LOCK-ON.\p"
	.string "Yet a battle is more than a list\n"
	.string "of types. You have shown me that.$"
